abstract: >-
  Yin and yang membranes linked by a wormhole inside the 3x3
  density-matrix arena: crossings carry a membrane's present
  configuration as a per-cell convex mixture, gated by the receiving
  engine's frozen guards, with an external observer recording REPORTED
  outcomes and an external calibrator updating an assumed model only
  or refusing. Mun Seok Lee is cited as inspiration only for the
  Digital to Wave paradigm.
